Experiment logs: Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International
=========================================================================

This file covers the experiment logs and generated outputs under
`results/logs/`. Everything else in this repository — source code under
`src/`, tests under `tests/`, scripts under `scripts/` and configuration
under `configs/` — is licensed under Apache-2.0; see LICENSE.

Why these files carry a different licence
-----------------------------------------
The per-round logs record model generations produced while training on
questions from Natural Questions (`google-research-datasets/nq_open`) with
passages from a mirror of the DPR Wikipedia split
(`kenhktsui/wiki_dpr_e5`). Both sources derive from Wikipedia and are
distributed under CC BY-SA 3.0. Generated text in the logs therefore
reproduces material derived from a ShareAlike corpus, and the logs are
released under CC BY-SA 4.0 so that the obligation travels with them.

Neither the base model nor the source corpora are redistributed here. They
are fetched from the Hugging Face Hub at run time; their identifiers and the
exact column projection used are recorded in
`configs/experiment_config.yaml`.

